# Optional: enables Google Drive sync. Without it, the app runs fully offline
# and the Cloud-sync card stays disabled (local JSON export/import still works).
#
# Create one at https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
#   - OAuth client type: Web application
#   - Authorized JavaScript origins: your app origin(s), e.g.
#       http://localhost:53134  and  https://<you>.github.io
#   - Enable the "Google Drive API" for the project
#   - Scope used: drive.appdata (a hidden per-app folder; non-sensitive, no
#     Google verification review needed)
# The client ID is public by design — safe to commit/ship. There is no secret.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=
